      "mds:procedureDetails": "4-Cyclohexyl-N-methyl-N-[4-(3-methylamino-2-oxopyrrolidin-1-yl)phenyl]benzamide (52 mg) was mixed with pyridine (0.5 ml) and acetic anhydride (130 mg) and, after 3 hours, volatile fractions were removed in vacuo. This resulted in the product with the molecular weight of 447.58 (C27H33N3O3); MS (ESI): 448 (M+H+).",
